* CABSRT06 - MERGE THE SWITCHED/SPECIAL/UNE RATED STREAMS
* MERGES THE THREE ELEMENT-TYPE RATED OUTPUTS (CABRAT03
* SWITCHED ACCESS, CABRAT04 SPECIAL ACCESS, CABRAT05 UNE)
* BACK INTO ONE STREAM BY BAN/SEQ AHEAD OF CABRAT11.  ALL
* THREE INPUTS MUST ALREADY BE IN BAN/SEQ ORDER OR THE MERGE
* PRODUCES GARBAGE SILENTLY - SORT DOES NOT VALIDATE MERGE
* INPUT ORDER.
*
* THE INCLUDE KEEPS ONLY THE CURRENT BILLING CYCLE.  THE
* CYCLE LITERAL BELOW IS MAINTAINED BY HAND - OPERATIONS
* UPDATES IT ON THE FIRST WORKING DAY OF EACH BILL PERIOD.
* THIS WAS NEEDED IN 2009 WHEN A STUCK GDG POINTER LEFT TWO
* CYCLES OF RATED OUTPUT IN THE SAME GENERATION.  AS OF THE
* 2015 GDG BASE REBUILD THAT CONDITION CANNOT RECUR, BUT THE
* INCLUDE WAS NEVER TAKEN BACK OUT AND STILL HAS TO BE HAND
* MAINTAINED EVERY CYCLE.
 MERGE FIELDS=(9,13,CH,A,22,9,CH,A)
 INCLUDE COND=(180,6,CH,EQ,C'202608')
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
